  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/DataDog/datadog-lambda-rb/zipball/v3.31.0",
  "body": "> [!NOTE]\r\n> #### Datadog tracer bumped to 2.46\r\n> This release bumps the `dd-trace-rb` dependency to `2.46` \r\n\r\n```yml\r\n# AWS Commercial\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-2:31\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-2-ARM:31\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-3:31\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-3-ARM:31\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-4:31\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-4-ARM:31\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby4-0:31\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Ruby4-0-ARM:31\r\n\r\n# AWS GovCloud\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-2:31\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-2-ARM:31\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-3:31\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-3-ARM:31\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-4:31\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby3-4-ARM:31\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby4-0:31\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Ruby4-0-ARM:31\r\n\r\nACCOUNT =\r\n002406178527 for us1 environment\r\n486696501492 for us2 environment\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Stop duplicate CI runs on PR branches by @lucaspimentel in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-rb/pull/166\r\n* upgrade gitlab to node 24 by @ojproductions in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-rb/pull/150\r\n* pin multi_json by @ojproductions in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-rb/pull/168\r\n* stop pinning tracer version when building layer by @ojproductions in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-rb/pull/151\r\n* v3.31.0 by @ojproductions in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-rb/pull/169\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-rb/compare/v3.30.0...v3.31.0",
  "mentions_count": 2
}
